  "reference_source": [
    "rSa derives running from task process state; its onResize calls qc.resize(surfaceId,cols,rows) only while running.",
    "w9e passes onResize through dno to $At. $At fits a measured terminal and calls the callback with actual terminal cols/rows when dimensions change; callback changes have a same-size path.",
    "qc imports the ts singleton. DAt creates $kt; its createSession constructs V9 and stores it by resolved session ID. $kt.resize looks up that controller and passes cols/rows.",
    "V9.resize updates replay/screen state and forwards to its retained backendSession.resize. The local ySt backend checks isAlive and invokes pty_resize with the PTY ID, cols and rows.",
    "V9.spawnBackendSession sets initial geometry from screen state and rechecks geometry after readiness. The native implementation of Conductor pty_resize is outside this retained source inquiry."
  ],
  "current_source": [
    "At the pinned main, ScriptOutput fits visible local xterm geometry but exposes no onResize callback.",
    "The checked scripts API, Tauri command group and RunManager have no run_script_resize route.",
    "Merged #1085 retains the live script PTY input master and runId. Resize will reuse this same owner and lifetime, not introduce a second PTY."
  ],
  "design": {
    "input": "workspaceId + scriptId + runId + measured positive u16 cols/rows",
    "route": "visible ScriptOutput fit -> current running ScriptsPanel callback -> scripts API -> registered script IPC -> RunManager generation check -> retained Process master",
    "alternatives": [
      "Reuse #1085 Process master and RunManager lifetime gate (selected)",
      "Resolve a generic PtyManager by workspace/script (rejected: can target replacement and duplicates ownership)"
    ],
    "lifecycle": "Only running identified runs; stop/exit/stale/workspace replacement cannot resize a new generation. Already-measured dimensions must reach a new current run without remounting output."
  },
